I agents at scale. Learn how to fine-tune models to drive better outcomes affordably, and why scaling law says to build a specialised flywheel. Please be aware that attendance is first-come, first-served.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T10:00:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T10:45:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"81884352-4ed3-4bb0-b44b-ca52a6b8bf51","name":"Masterclass 2","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"cf72292a-020b-4fba-86b6-59831cf1f439","name":"Yu Liu","company_name":null,"job_title":null,"role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":null,"thumb":null,"medium":null,"large":null,"original":null}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Masterclasses","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"35589fdd-1482-48df-9e64-e98fd51a0763","slug":"the-future-of-health-is-prediction","title":"The future of health is prediction","description":"Why wait for illness when your blood already holds the key to your future health? Humanity CEO Peter Ward breaks down how AI can read standard blood panels to measure biological age and flag disease risks long before symptoms surface.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T10:00:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T10:20:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"ca314426-f597-44d0-b3cd-f3017a2bbcb4","name":"Stage 5","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"245d0443-efa5-4b42-944f-839d5ea8b52e","name":"Peter Ward","company_name":"Humanity","job_title":"Co-founder & CEO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/7j1qaakz5kxuoptdrn1ed7mlsan9?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/7j1qaakz5kxuoptdrn1ed7mlsan9?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/7j1qaakz5kxuoptdrn1ed7mlsan9?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-